{"id":"u-cc0835b3-c05d-4ed5-b1bc-9f798ad64d4b","src":"community","title":"Eden Power-building 5/3/1","author":"Ahmed Elrayah","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/tsAkDk-eden-power-building-531","desc":"This program is an upper/lower bodybuilding and 5/3/1 powerlifting hybrid program where the first 3 days of the program are powerlifting program where you do deadlift, bench and squat and the last 2 days are hypertrophy days with one being dedicated to the upper body and the second day is a day for the lower body. the program is mainly 4 cycles for powerlifting and if at any point you feel like you need to deload after any of the cycles you can add a deload week, the program has deload weeks and that can be used as a template. The bodybuilding days are generally the same, the goal is to do your warmup and then get into set 1 which is the heaviest set and you should go to failure during that set and then the second set is a backoff set where you drop the weight by a bit and try to get the same amount of reps. Enter your actual 1rm for all lifts and for the variations(Paused) enter your 1rm for their normal variations.(paused deadlift 1rm= normal deadlift 1rm)","level":["Beginner","Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-25T22:54:41.137Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Deadlift","Bench","Squat","Upper","Lower"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":59},{"r":5,"pct":68},{"pct":76}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":60},{"r":5,"pct":68},{"pct":77}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":50}]},{"